## Previously raised findings (review-round registry)

These defects were raised on earlier review rounds of this PR. For each finding below: verify fixed (cite the fixing hunk), withdraw (reason required), or mark re-introduced. New claims need new evidence — a claim already on this list is answered, not re-raised.

| id | status | severity | file | claim |
|----|--------|----------|------|-------|
| F1 | open | BLOCKING | js/unit-tests/testRunner.js | 🚨 blocking ci red — the makerequire fix landed in the wrong harness this pr teaches four production modules to require common probecache js smagent js sm tickorchestrator js sm validationchecksync js sm sources githubsource js and adds probecache to real common modules in js unit tests testrunner js this line — but ci s quality job runs the node mirror js unit tests node testrunner js see github workflows quality yml node ci run with coverage js node testrunner js files whose real common modules map does not have the entry makerequire s fallback node testrunner js 243 throws makerequire module not found common probecache js for every suite that loads those modules — node testrunner s own comment pins the contract same map as testrunner js reproduced locally on 05333273 test smagent js — 597 failed 38 passed test smgithubsource js — 119 failed 12 passed test smgitlabsource js — 9 failed 6 passed both recorded crap check runs are red with exactly this error runs 44100791990 14 15 and 44101030859 14 30 commit 05333273 fix add probecache js common probecache js to real common modules in js unit tests node testrunner js note for the fix loadmodule re evaluates the module per call so the gh 1000 it 1 phantom heal suites each get a fresh probe holder — the existing live call assertions stay valid once the map resolves |
| F2 | open | IMPORTANT | js/common/probeCache.js | ⚠️ important cachedrunjobs caches failures for the whole ttl — its own contract says the opposite the comment right above line 103 documents empty payloads stay uncached so a failed listing retries next rule — but cachedprobe line 97 caches anything that is not undefined null and the catch path here returns which is neither so a failed gh api call is cached as a valid empty jobs table for the full probe ttl the unit test named exec failure warns and returns without caching the failure test probecache js 154 never asserts the no caching behavior no execcount check on a second call so it cannot catch the drift reproduced against this branch text exec calls after 2 cachedrunjobs with failing exec 1 ← second call rode the cache puts 1 — empty failure payload was cached impact one transient gh failure e g 502 yields 30s of empty stamp job tables with no retry — pre pr every stamp re fetched a successful but empty parse is cached too which is fine for fan out but also contradicts the documented retries next rule fix cache only non empty results e g have the catch return undefined and or gate probeput on data data length for this site and pin the contract with a second call execcount assertion in the test |
| F3 | open | IMPORTANT | js/smAgent.js | ⚠️ important the promised iocachettlms jobparam is not shipped ticket contract gap the pr description and ticket input pr 1514 ticket md same text state iocachettlms jobparam exposes the io cache ttl 60s default unchanged no such knob exists in this diff or anywhere in the repo — grep rni iocachettl js json docs returns zero hits and js common smprovider js 74 75 still hardcodes sm io cache ttl ms 60 1000 with no jobparam wiring only liveprobettlms is wired this line via applyprobetuning either expose the knob for real e g accept iocachettlms from jobparams and feed smprovider s io cache init reset the same way applyprobetuning feeds the probe layer or amend the pr description so the stated contract matches the shipped diff as written an operator following the description cannot tune the io cache ttl |
| F4 | open | SUGGESTION | js/common/probeCache.js | 💡 suggestion drops is dead telemetry — the banner will always print drops 0 bump is exported but never called in production code repo wide grep only probecache js defines it tests call it directly and nothing else writes stats drops the sm agent complete line will therefore always carry drops 0 the gh 1000 divergence self heal drops smprovider s iocache entry githubsource js 971 which is a different cache from this probe layer — if that drop signal is what the counter is meant to surface route it through bump drops at that site otherwise drop the field from the banner line to keep the telemetry honest |

### How to answer

Add a `findingReview` block to `outputs/pr_review.json` (alongside `inlineComments`):

```json
{"findingReview": {
  "dispositions": [
    {"n": 1, "status": "fixed", "hunk": "<file:lines \u2014 the fixing hunk>"},
    {"n": 2, "status": "withdrawn", "reason": "<why this is not a defect>"},
    {"n": 3, "status": "re-introduced"}
  ],
  "confirmations": [
    {"proposedFor": 1, "same": true}
  ]
}}
```

Unconfirmed candidates become new identities (the merge bias is confirm-only); a genuinely new finding on a resolved item is expected to be raised again with new evidence.

